SSAqua_Interior11_Text_GentlemanEdwardIntro::
	.string "Oh, no. I’ve lost something that’s\n"
	.string "very important.$"

SSAqua_Interior11_Text_GentlemanEdwardDefeat::
	.string "I... I can’t find it...$"

SSAqua_Interior11_Text_GentlemanEdward::
	.string "I give up. Son, you don’t have to\n"
	.string "look. Just forget about it!$"

SSAqua_Interior11_Text_BurglarCoryIntro::
	.string "Yeehaw!\n"
	.string "Lucky!$"

SSAqua_Interior11_Text_BurglarCoryDefeat::
	.string "How unlucky!\n"
	.string "I lost!$"

SSAqua_Interior11_Text_BurglarCory::
	.string "I found a pretty coin here.\n"
	.string "Someone must have lost it...$"

SSAqua_Interior11_Text_Sailor_1::
	.string "Yeah, I’m a sailor, all right.\p"
	.string "I wasn’t goofing off!\p"
	.string "This cabin was vacant, so I just\n"
	.string "took a quick nap!\p"
	.string "Ah, forget it!\n"
	.string "Let’s battle!$"

SSAqua_Interior11_Text_SailorDefeat::
	.string "Sorry! It’s all my fault!$"

SSAqua_Interior11_Text_SailorVictory::
	.string "Yaaaawn...$"

SSAqua_Interior11_Text_Sailor_2::
	.string "Being a sailor, I have to do phys-\n"
	.string "ical labor. It’s exhausting!$"
